#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#A speed target can be calculated along a path while attempting to remain within specified target limits of lateral and longitudinal acceleration.
#
#The target is calculated over a specified preview distance and passed to the CarSim closed-loop speed controller to modulate throttle and brakes.
#
#In this case, the driver's target path is a set of X-Y coordinates, such as might be obtained from GPS or recordings of lateral acceleration and speed.
#
#More information is provided with the linked Procedure.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

